OL,3,GNEWSARare birds 'recovering' after
OL,4,Abreeding season
OL,5,
OL,6,FColonies of rare birds are showing
OL,7,Fsigns of recovery after years of bird
OL,8,Fflu, flooding, and unpredictable
OL,9,Fweather, the National Trust has said.
OL,11,FLittle terns at Long Nanny, on the
OL,12,FNorthumberland coast, have had a
OL,13,Frecord-breaking breeding season, while
OL,14,Fmore than 1,100 pairs of Sandwich terns
OL,15,Freturned to breed at Blakeney Point in
OL,16,FNorfolk after a two-year absence.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
